{"step_index":262,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T20:14:03Z","thinking":"**Defining Key Contexts**\n\nI'm now focusing on creating crucial contexts within `frontend/src/context/`. Specifically, I'm setting up `AuthContext.jsx` to manage user authentication, token handling, and related actions. Alongside this, `WebSocketContext.jsx` will handle the STOMP client connection, manage subscriptions to match rooms, and process user notifications.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import React, { createContext, useContext, useState, useEffect } from 'react';\\nimport { authApi } from '../api';\\n\\nconst AuthContext = createContext(null);\\n\\nexport const AuthProvider = ({ children }) => {\\n  const [user, setUser] = useState(null);\\n  const [token, setToken] = useState(localStorage.getItem('codeduel_token'));\\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const initAuth = async () => {\\n      const storedToken = localStorage.getItem('codeduel_token');\\n      if (storedToken) {\\n        try {\\n          const res = await authApi.getMe();\\n          if (res.data) {\\n            setUser(res.data);\\n          }\\n        } catch (err) {\\n          console.error('Session restore failed:', err);\\n          logout();\\n        }\\n      }\\n      setLoading(false);\\n    };\\n    initAuth();\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const login = (authData) => {\\n    localStorage.setItem('codeduel_token', authData.token);\\n    setToken(authData.token);\\n    setUser({\\n      id: authData.id,\\n      username: authData.username,\\n      email: authData.email,\\n      role: authData.role,\\n      rating: authData.rating,\\n      globalRank: authData.globalRank\\n    });\\n  };\\n\\n  const logout = () => {\\n    localStorage.removeItem('codeduel_token');\\n    localStorage.removeItem('codeduel_user');\\n    setToken(null);\\n    setUser(null);\\n  };\\n\\n  const updateUser = (updatedFields) => {\\n    setUser(prev => ({ ...prev, ...updatedFields }));\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <AuthContext.Provider value={{ user, token, isAuthenticated: !!token, loading, login, logout, updateUser }}>\\n      {children}\\n    </AuthContext.Provider>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nexport const useAuth = () => {\\n  const context = useContext(AuthContext);\\n  if (!context) {\\n    throw new Error('useAuth must be used within an AuthProvider');\\n  }\\n  return context;\\n};\\n\"","Description":"\"AuthContext for handling authentication state\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\rajan\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\codeduel\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\context\\\\AuthContext.jsx\"","toolAction":"\"Creating AuthContext.jsx\"","toolSummary":"\"Write AuthContext\""}}]}
