{"step_index":266,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T20:14:13Z","thinking":"**Constructing Core Components**\n\nI'm now generating the initial components within `frontend/src/components/`. Specifically, I'm defining the structure for `Navbar.jsx`, complete with the logo, navigation links (Dashboard, Versus, Practice, Leaderboard, Matches), the user profile chip and admin link if applicable, and the logout button. Next, `Footer.jsx` will be a simple footer with useful links.\n\n\n**Defining Match Components**\n\nI've been concentrating on the key match components. I've outlined `CountdownOverlay.jsx` for the pre-match animation. Furthermore, I've got a comprehensive `OpponentCard.jsx` showing real-time telemetry like status badges and a progress bar. Next is the time-sensitive `ServerTimer.jsx` with warning colors.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import React from 'react';\\nimport { Navigate, Outlet } from 'react-router-dom';\\nimport { useAuth } from '../context/AuthContext';\\n\\nexport const ProtectedRoute = () => {\\n  const { isAuthenticated, loading } = useAuth();\\n\\n  if (loading) {\\n    return (\\n      <div className=\\\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center bg-dark-900 text-slate-400\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"animate-spin rounded-full h-10 w-10 border-b-2 border-indigo-500\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  return isAuthenticated ? <Outlet /> : <Navigate to=\\\"/login\\\" replace />;\\n};\\n\\nexport const AdminRoute = () => {\\n  const { user, isAuthenticated, loading } = useAuth();\\n\\n  if (loading) {\\n    return (\\n      <div className=\\\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center bg-dark-900 text-slate-400\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"animate-spin rounded-full h-10 w-10 border-b-2 border-indigo-500\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  if (!isAuthenticated) return <Navigate to=\\\"/login\\\" replace />;\\n  if (u