{"step_index":278,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T20:14:50Z","thinking":"**Defining ServerTimer Components**\n\nI'm now focusing on implementing `ServerTimer.jsx`. I've outlined the component's functionality, specifying that it receives `initialRemainingSeconds`, `startTime`, and `timeLimitSeconds`. It will maintain a local ticker that decrements every second, handle resynchronization with server updates, render time in MM:SS format, and apply warning styles when time falls below 3 minutes.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import React, { useState, useEffect } from 'react';\\nimport { Timer, AlertCircle } from 'lucide-react';\\n\\nexport const ServerTimer = ({ initialRemainingSeconds = 900, onTimeUp }) => {\\n  const [seconds, setSeconds] = useState(initialRemainingSeconds);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    setSeconds(initialRemainingSeconds);\\n  }, [initialRemainingSeconds]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (seconds <= 0) {\\n      if (onTimeUp) onTimeUp();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    const interval = setInterval(() => {\\n      setSeconds((prev) => {\\n        if (prev <= 1) {\\n          clearInterval(interval);\\n          if (onTimeUp) onTimeUp();\\n          return 0;\\n        }\\n        return prev - 1;\\n      });\\n    }, 1000);\\n\\n    return () => clearInterval(interval);\\n  }, [seconds, onTimeUp]);\\n\\n  const formatTime = (secs) => {\\n    const mins = Math.floor(secs / 60);\\n    const remainingSecs = secs % 60;\\n    return `${mins.toString().padStart(2, '0')}:${remainingSecs.toString().padStart(2, '0')}`;\\n  };\\n\\n  const isLowTime = seconds < 180; // < 3 mins\\n  const isCriticalTime = seconds < 60; // < 1 min\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      className={`flex items-center space-x-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 font-mono ${\\n        isCriticalTime\\n          ? 'bg-rose-950/40 border-rose-500/60 text-rose-400 animate-pulse neon-glow-rose'\\n          : isLowTime\\n          ? 'bg-amber-950/30 border-amber-500/40 text-amber-300'\\n          : 'bg-dark-800 border-dark-600 text-slate-200'\\n      }`}\\n    >\\n      <Timer className={`w-4 h-4 ${isCriticalTime ? 'text-rose-400 animate-spin' : isLowTime ? 'text-amber-400' : 'text-cyan-400'}`} />\\n      <span className=\\\"font-bold text-lg tracking-wider\\\">\\n        {formatTime(seconds)}\\n      </span>\\n      {isCriticalTime && (\\n        <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-sans font-bold bg-rose-500/30 text-rose-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\\\">\\n          TIME RUNNING OUT\\n        </span>\\n      )}\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\"","Description":"\"ServerTimer synchronized countdown timer component\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\rajan\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\codeduel\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\components\\\\ServerTimer.jsx\"","toolAction":"\"Creating ServerTimer.jsx\"","toolSummary":"\"Write ServerTimer component\""}}]}
